<title>JAPAN: Denyo -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Denyo -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 19.15		vs	   16.57</p>
<p> Operating	    1.83		vs	    1.07</p>
<p> Current		2.08		vs	    1.24</p>
<p> Net		    1.02		vs	  641    million</p>
<p> EPS		   35.22 yen	  vs	   22.07 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     29 million	  vs	  29 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Denyo Co Ltd is the largest maker of welding machines and power generators.</p>
</text>
